  "question": {
    "text": "What is the spin-only magnetic moment value (B.M.) of a divalent metal ion with atomic number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;in its&nbsp;aqueous solution?"
